    "answer": {
      "short": "$(ac+bd)^2+(ad-bc)^2=(a^2+b^2)(c^2+d^2)$.\n\nExpand the right-hand side of the given identity; the $2abcd$ terms cancel, then factor in pairs.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(ac+bd)^2+(ad-bc)^2&=a^2c^2+2abcd+b^2d^2+a^2d^2-2abcd+b^2c^2\\\\(ac+bd)^2+(ad-bc)^2&=a^2(c^2+d^2)+b^2(c^2+d^2)\\\\(ac+bd)^2+(ad-bc)^2&=(a^2+b^2)(c^2+d^2).\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
